# --- Secrets: never commit these ---
**/.ssh/id_*
**/.ssh/*.pem
**/.ssh/known_hosts*
**/.config/gh/hosts.yml          # gh CLI auth token lives here
**/*token*
**/*secret*
**/*.key
**/.netrc

# --- IDE / app caches & state (machine/version specific) ---
JetBrains/
DataGripProjects/
**/.idea/
**/*.iml

# --- Editor / tooling junk ---
**/.claude/
**/.DS_Store          # macOS Finder metadata
**/.cache/
**/*.swp
**/*.bak

# --- Yazi caches ---
yazi/.config/yazi/.claude/
